{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Dragonborn\n\nNote: This Feat is intended to use instead of the regular Dragon Hide feat.\n\nYou evolve in your body, manifesting scales and strong muscles reminiscent of your draconic ancestors. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Strength, Constitution, or Dexterity score by 1, up to a maximum of 20.\n\n- Your scales harden, adapting themselves to your best physical traits. While you aren\u0027t wearing armor, you can calculate your AC as 13 + your Strength, Constitution or Dexterity modifier (whichever is higher). You can use a shield and still gain this benefit. If otherwise you have a feature that grant\u0027s you a higher AC or equal AC or are wearing armor, increase your AC by 1 instead.\n\n- Your hit point maximum increases by an amount equal to your level when you gain this feat. Whenever you gain a level thereafter, your hit point maximum increases by an additional 1 point.","level":1}],"id":"dragon_hide","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Dragon Constitution [SM] [R]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}